{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10282250","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10282250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028225001:1":{"text":"흑흑... 다 제 잘못이에요. 제가 제대로 돌보지 못했어요.","source_cn":"呜呜……都怪我，没能好好照顾我的花。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32C5D8D952AC6955","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028225002:1":{"text":"이곳의 꽃은... 한 송이 한 송이가 다 아름다워서 전부 기억하고 있었어요...","source_cn":"这里的花……每一株都很漂亮，它们的样子我都记得……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A3B82479FA60C0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028225003:1":{"text":"기분이 좋지 않을 때면, 이곳에 와서 물도 주고 벌레도 없애주었어요. 꽃들만 잘 자라면, 저도 덩달아 기분이 좋아지곤 했거든요.","source_cn":"我不开心的时候，就来这里给它们浇水、除虫。只要它们长得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEBB27485CB43911","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028225004:1":{"text":"하지만 부패가 생긴 뒤로 선생님께서 아카데미 밖으로 나가는 걸 금지하시는 바람에... 흑흑, 이렇게 변해버릴 줄은 몰랐어요...","source_cn":"可是附近发生腐化以后，老师禁止我们出学院……呜呜，我不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3CBB68AD9052690","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028225005:1":{"text":"흑흑... 혹시, 저, 저를 도와... 꽃들을 묻어줄 수 있나요?","source_cn":"呜呜……你们，能、能帮我……帮我把它们埋葬了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x023FE4D24E89D413","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1028225005":{"text":"흑흑... 혹시, 저, 저를 도와... 꽃들을 묻어줄 수 있나요?","source_cn":"呜呜……你们，能、能帮我……帮我把它们埋葬了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x023FE4D24E89D413","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028225006:1":{"text":"고마워요... 흑, 고맙습니다...","source_cn":"谢谢……呜，谢谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85E29996F1FCEB12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"(고개를 끄덕여 대답한다)","source_cn":"（点头答应）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x34FA657DE1102E88","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(고개를 끄덕여 대답한다)","female":"(고개를 끄덕여 대답한다)","variant_male_record_index":"61730","variant_female_record_index":"61731","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兰迪":{"text":"랜디","source":"兰迪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":1}}